      <title>华为Pura X View把折叠屏优势塞进6.68mm直板</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260830/%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%BAPura-X-View%E6%8A%8A%E6%8A%98%E5%8F%A0%E5%B1%8F%E4%BC%98%E5%8A%BF%E5%A1%9E%E8%BF%9B6.68mm%E7%9B%B4%E6%9D%BF/</link>
